                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a3be868-8dc0-3a19-aaa1-04ead80f5dc7",
                        "entry_id": "0682f040-18f0-31a5-8752-c8aceaf69cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A shell that is the principal source of structural strength of an object; also, its design and construction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c1bda41-8884-4bb9-aa73-16816e468a8a",
                                "sense_id": "0a3be868-8dc0-3a19-aaa1-04ead80f5dc7",
                                "text": "In selected cases where there is advanced (TASC) D aorto-iliac occlusive disease, treatment with a unibody stent-graft positioned at the aortic bifurcation is a safe and effective treatment."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ce06a6a-bb8f-3399-8aad-207bcafc6f33",
                        "entry_id": "0682f040-18f0-31a5-8752-c8aceaf69cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A style of mobile phone, tablet, or laptop computer where the user cannot replace the battery because the device is manufactured as a single sealed unit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "euphemistic",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89b7a3eb-b85f-42cc-86ab-dc75736977f1",
                                "sense_id": "1ce06a6a-bb8f-3399-8aad-207bcafc6f33",
                                "text": "We're looking at the most recent unibody white MacBook here; the first to contain batteries that aren't considered user-serviceable by Apple."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a39e373-bcd0-4d83-9a74-cc1034e2779e",
                                "sense_id": "1ce06a6a-bb8f-3399-8aad-207bcafc6f33",
                                "text": "Aesthetics (ID, industrial design) are another obvious reason to go that route, with designers opting for a fluid, unibody motif, since sealed phone body is a beautifully crafted device \"... created from a single piece of polycarbonate with precision machined details.\" This ID design philosophy is in a direct conflict with customers' desire of extended use of their purchased phones; that is, when the sealed battery fails to function because of the limited charging cycles, and a replacement is needed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "008b88b5-3326-434b-8fdb-d9341747cdf2",
                                "sense_id": "1ce06a6a-bb8f-3399-8aad-207bcafc6f33",
                                "text": "Many persons miss this option to simply put in a new battery when the old one is defective as the unibody designs started to take over."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
